knext bundled fix for vinext 1.1.0 (dist output)
Upstream: https://github.com/cloudflare/vinext/pull/3682
What it fixes: A GET/HEAD request for an unmatched App Router path whose Sec-Fetch-Dest is a non-HTML subresource destination (image, font, script, manifest, ...) compiled and rendered the full not-found page. Next.js short-circuits these before invoking the not-found route, returning the same plain-text 'Not Found' body it already uses for invalid _next/static/* paths.
Retire: delete this file (and its manifest entry) when the pinned vinext is >= the first
release that includes cloudflare/vinext#3682.
Ported by hand from the upstream src change to the published 1.1.0 dist files.
Applied by `knext vinext-patches` (runs from the app's postinstall and before `knext build`).

